      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    returns = [5, 3, 8, 2, 7, 3, 6, 4, 5, 7, 6, 4]\n    lag = 1\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    mean_return = sum(returns) / len(returns)\n    numerator = sum(\n        (returns[i] - mean_return) * (returns[i - lag] - mean_return)\n        for i in range(lag, len(returns))\n    )\n    denominator = sum((value - mean_return) ** 2 for value in returns)\n    autocorrelation = numerator / denominator if denominator != 0 else 0\n    answer = round(autocorrelation, 4)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
